  title "Forty-Seven Days of Margin"
  summary "Lianhinglou, a beacon-keeper, ventures into the forbidden ☽'dwell Teneanemus~ chamber in the Wane Oncea tunnels to save their colony from resource collapse, discovering ancient knowledge that combines aurora-light with deep-pressure techniques. Teaching the dangerous Shell Hatch technique to Founder Mingmeyang allows them to map krill blooms and extend their dwindling supplies, though the practice costs Lianhinglou their memories and leaves both practitioners bearing mysterious crystalline scars. Despite Mingmeyang's current deterioration and whispers of corruption, Lianhinglou insists they only did what was necessary to keep the colony alive and that Mingmeyang never explicitly asked them to stop."
